    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λώτισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a
				flower</i>: metaph., 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθος</span>
			 and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄωτος</span>, <i>the fairest,
				choicest, best</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς Ἑλλάδος λωτίσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1593
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				99.17a
			</span></i>.</div>
